<section class="how-it-works" id="services">
  <div class="how-inner">
    <div class="how-header">
      <div>
        <div class="section-label" style="background:var(--terra-pale);color:var(--terra);">How it works</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">From <em>brief</em> to buy button.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-body">We handle recruiting, training, scheduling, and analytics — so your team gets results without the operational overhead.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">🤝</div><div class="step-title">Brand Onboarding</div><div class="step-desc">We learn your product, your story, and the sales outcomes that matter most to your team.</div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">⭐</div><div class="step-title">Ambassador Matching</div><div class="step-desc">Trained, nutrition-certified ambassadors who genuinely love your category — wellness, food, beverage, or beauty.</div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">🛒</div><div class="step-title">In-Store Execution</div><div class="step-desc">Demos run on schedule, retailer-compliant, with real-time check-in and photo documentation.</div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">📊</div><div class="step-title">Analytics & Reporting</div><div class="step-desc">Branded performance reports with conversion data, location rankings, and trend analysis.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="services">
  <div class="services-inner">
    <div class="services-left">
      <div class="section-label">Services</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Built for <em>natural</em> & specialty CPG.</h2>
      <p class="section-body" style="margin-top:16px;">We specialize in brands that need authentic, knowledgeable advocates at the shelf — not just warm bodies.</p>
      <br><br>
      <a href="https://calendly.com/grassrootsmarketing/introductory-call" target="_blank" class="btn-primary">📅 Book a Call</a>
    </div>
    <div class="services-right">
      <div class="service-item"><div class="service-icon">🌿</div><div class="service-name">In-Store Product Demonstrations</div><div class="service-desc">Live sampling events executed by trained brand ambassadors at natural and specialty retail locations nationwide. Setup, coaching, and post-demo reporting included.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Whole Foods</span><span class="tag">Sprouts</span><span class="tag">Erewhon</span><span class="tag">Central Market</span></div></div>
      <div class="service-item"><div class="service-icon">🤝</div><div class="service-name">Brand Ambassador Programs</div><div class="service-desc">Ongoing ambassador relationships that build genuine brand advocacy — at demos, events, farmers markets, and retailer activations.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Annual engagement</span><span class="tag">Performance tracking</span><span class="tag">Incentive programs</span></div></div>
      <div class="service-item"><div class="service-icon">📊</div><div class="service-name">Demo Performance Analytics</div><div class="service-desc">Branded analytics reports from our Promomash data — location rankings, time-slot optimization, ambassador leaderboards, and retailer comparisons.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Monthly reports</span><span class="tag">Retailer comparisons</span><span class="tag">Custom dashboards</span></div></div>
      <div class="service-item"><div class="service-icon">🗓️</div><div class="service-name">Demo Scheduling & Coordination</div><div class="service-desc">Turnkey scheduling across multiple markets with automated confirmations, ambassador assignments, and retailer compliance management.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Multi-market</span><span class="tag">Retailer-compliant</span><span class="tag">Real-time tracking</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

