<section class="testimonials" id="testimonials">
  <div class="testimonials-inner">
    <div class="section-label">What brands say</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Results that <em>speak</em> for themselves.</h2>
    <div class="testimonials-grid">
      <div class="tcard"><div class="tcard-quote">Their team ran engaging demos across the country, introducing our chips to a wide range of consumers and Sprouts staff. They showed flexibility — whether stepping in at the request of a Sprouts employee or accommodating last-minute needs, the team always made it happen.</div><div class="tcard-author"><div class="tcard-name">Janice Greenwald</div><div class="tcard-role">Fractional CMO</div><div class="tcard-company">El Nacho</div></div></div>
      <div class="tcard"><div class="tcard-quote">Bridget and her team were a crucial part of our success on the Sprouts innovation set — helping us reach new shoppers, drive trial, and build a base of repeat Harken lovers. Their recaps are best in class!</div><div class="tcard-author"><div class="tcard-name">Whitney Hemy</div><div class="tcard-role">Head of Sales</div><div class="tcard-company">Harken Sweets</div></div></div>
      <div class="tcard"><div class="tcard-quote">Their meticulously executed demos were a key factor in graduating from the Sprouts Innovation Program. The detailed reports gave us valuable insights and reassurance that our precious marketing dollars were being put to good use.</div><div class="tcard-author"><div class="tcard-name">Tom Chinery</div><div class="tcard-role">Founder</div><div class="tcard-company">Peak Protein</div></div></div>
      <div class="tcard"><div class="tcard-quote">Grassroots is an absolute pleasure to collaborate with, combining efficiency and exceptional communication. Their reporting is both thorough and easily digestible, which provides helpful insights into our product & brand!</div><div class="tcard-author"><div class="tcard-name">Kari Janapareddi</div><div class="tcard-role">Director of Sales</div><div class="tcard-company">GoodSAM Foods</div></div></div>
      <div class="tcard"><div class="tcard-quote">Bridget is always prompt with responses and scheduling, and the data provided from the demo is incredibly thorough. Grassroots event recaps are invaluable to my department as a whole. I would strongly recommend Grassroots to any organization looking for high-impact in-store interactions.</div><div class="tcard-author"><div class="tcard-name">Nicole Torney</div><div class="tcard-role">Events & Demo Coordinator</div><div class="tcard-company">Clover Sonoma</div></div></div>
      <div class="tcard"><div class="tcard-quote">The Grassroots team is amazing to work with. They are extremely professional and execute at a very high level. They understand our brand well and consistently do a great job selling product. Their elite reports make them a true extension of our team.</div><div class="tcard-author"><div class="tcard-name">Griffin Spolansky</div><div class="tcard-role">Co-Founder</div><div class="tcard-company">Mezcla</div></div></div>
      <div class="tcard" style="background:rgba(125,217,154,0.08);border-color:rgba(125,217,154,0.2);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:40px 32px;"><div style="font-size:36px;margin-bottom:12px;">🌱</div><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;">Your brand, next.</div><div style="font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin-bottom:24px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:600;">Join the growing roster of natural CPG brands building at shelf with Grassroots.</div><a href="https://calendly.com/grassrootsmarketing/introductory-call" target="_blank" class="btn-primary">📅 Book a Call</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

